          "text": "Chaar factors: (1) LENGTH of conductor - zyada lambi wire, zyada resistance (R ∝ L). (2) AREA of cross-section - mota wire, kam resistance (R ∝ 1/A). (3) MATERIAL - different materials different resistance (Resistivity ρ). (4) TEMPERATURE - generally temp badhne se resistance badhta hai!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Formula kya hai?"
        }
      ],
      "navigation": {
        "next": "card_22_resistance_formula",
        "button_text": "Formula Dekho ➔"
