        "current": 29,
        "total": 72
      },
      "messages": [
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Raju, Christmas lights ke purane bulbs yaad hain? Ek bulb fuse hua toh sab bulbs off! Ye SERIES circuit tha. Series mein sab components ek hi path mein connected hote hain - ek ke baad doosra!"
