        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Perfect! SERIES CIRCUIT mein: (1) SAME current sabhi resistors se flow hota hai (I₁ = I₂ = I₃). (2) Total voltage = sum of individual voltages (V_total = V₁ + V₂ + V₃). (3) Equivalent resistance = R_eq = R₁ + R₂ + R₃ (ADD ho jate hain!)"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "raju",
          "text": "Toh series mein resistance badhta hai?"
