      "messages": [
        {
          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Haan! Series mein resistances ADD hote hain. Agar 10Ω, 20Ω aur 30Ω series mein hain toh total R = 10+20+30 = 60Ω. ⭐ NEET Trap: Ek component fail → pura circuit break! Disadvantage hai series ka. Advantage: current control easy (same current everywhere!)"
