          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Ulta hai! PARALLEL CIRCUIT mein components alag-alag branches mein connected hote hain. Current ko multiple paths milte hain! Example: Ghar ki sab lights parallel mein - ek off karo, baaki chalti rahein!"
