          "speaker": "aman",
          "text": "Example se clear hoga! Agar 10Ω aur 10Ω parallel mein hain: 1/R_eq = 1/10 + 1/10 = 2/10, toh R_eq = 10/2 = 5Ω. Dhyan do - parallel mein equivalent resistance kam ho jata hai! ⭐ BPSC/SSC Calculation Trap - Reciprocal formula galat lagane se answer wrong!"
        },
