          "text": "Haan! Parallel mein R_eq hamesha sabse chhote resistor se bhi kam hota hai! Advantage: (1) Ek component fail → baaki kaam karte rahein. (2) Har device ko same voltage milta hai. Isliye ghar mein PARALLEL wiring hoti hai - sab appliances 220V pe kaam karein!"
