          "text": "Bilkul! Isko quantify kiya James Prescott Joule ne - JOULE'S LAW OF HEATING: Heat produced H = I²Rt. Jahan I = current (A), R = resistance (Ω), t = time (seconds). Heat ka unit = JOULE (J). ⭐ NEET/BPSC High-Weightage Formula!"
